#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_context_menu
#! frames  420
#! poster  95
# The pointer rests on 'outlet': its tooltip shows a table of the patch's values. A right click on 'outlet' opens its
# menu: Duplicate inserts 'outlet-copy' below it. A right click on 'inlet', then Delete: the row goes. A right click
# below the rows opens the list's menu: Add a row appends 'patch-1'. The link 'What is a patch?' shows a line of help.
0   move 400 300
